128		 * 2+ for a jump that starts in the air (the double jump, or the first jump after walking off a ledge:
129		 * CheckJumpInput pre-increments the count to 1 while falling, then the successful jump increments it to 2).
130		 */
131		virtual void OnJumped_Implementation() override;
132	
133		/**
134		 * Horizontal velocity a committed jump takes off with (pure, tested).
135		 * InputDirection is the world-space movement direction held at takeoff (zero when none).
136		 * No input: returns CurrentVelocity unchanged (the jump keeps its drift). With input: the input direction
137		 * at max(CurrentSpeed, MaxWalkSpeed * MinSpeedMult).
138		 */
139		static FVector2D ComputeJumpHorizontalVelocity(const FVector2D& CurrentVelocity, const FVector2D& InputDirection, float MaxWalkSpeed, float MinSpeedMult);
140	
141	protected:
